Lots of people work in Malis's town. A carpenter makes tables, and an architect draws houses. A photographer takes pictures at weddings. The hairdresser cuts hair, and the waiter brings food. The cleaner keeps the school clean, the gardener grows flowers, and the postman brings letters.

